<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a third tranche of 5.0 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 3.45 percent.</p>
<p>		   Jan 1, 2004 CCT		Pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   6.15 pct		5.92 pct</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 7.05 pct		6.79 pct</p>
<p>    Assigned price	100.30	    100.65</p>
<p>    Total bids	  9.977 trln lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    5.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are for a previous auction on January 15 of the first tranche of January 1, 2004 CCTs.</p>
</text>
